OL,3,AState pension likely to rise by #488 a
OL,4,Ayear in April
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe state pension is likely to rise by
OL,7,F#488 next April to #13,036.40 a year,
OL,8,Fnew official figures suggest.
OL,10,FUnder the triple lock pension
OL,11,Fguarantee, the annual increase is based
OL,12,Fon either average wage growth,
OL,13,Finflation or 2.5% - whichever is
OL,14,Fhighest.
OL,16,FAverage wage growth, including bonuses,
OL,17,Feased to 3.9% between May and July,
OL,18,Faccording to the Office for National
OL,19,FStatistics. However, it remains above
OL,20,Fthe inflation at 2.9%.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
