OL,3,AState pension likely to rise by #488 a
OL,4,Ayear in April
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour made a manifesto pledge to keep
OL,7,Fthe triple lock - something Prime
OL,8,FMinister Andy Burnham has committed to
OL,9,Falthough the cost of the policy has
OL,10,Fcome under scrutiny as the number of
OL,11,Fpensioners is expected to rise in the
OL,12,Fcoming years.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
