OL,3,AAI regulation faces political deadlock
OL,4,Aas calls grow for Congress to act
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen President Donald Trump responded
OL,7,Fto mounting calls for a slowdown in the
OL,8,Fdevelopment of artificial intelligence
OL,9,F(AI) on Monday, he was unequivocal.
OL,11,F"AI taking over the World, destroying
OL,12,FHumanity, and all other things bad, is
OL,13,Fa HOAX," he wrote on social media. He
OL,14,Fearlier argued that "the only control
OL,15,For 'guardrails' that AI needs" is a
OL,16,F"strong and smart" president.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
